WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.450
Crouching light kick hits Ryu in the corner.

2
00:00:01.450 --> 00:00:02.800
OD Flash Knuckle launches Ryu.

3
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:03.950
OD Sand Blast and its follow-up extend the juggle.

4
00:00:03.950 --> 00:00:04.750
A second OD Sand Blast empties Luke’s remaining Drive.

5
00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:11.050
Luke activates Eraser while in Burnout.

6
00:00:11.050 --> 00:00:12.800
Eraser finishes with Ryu knocked down close by.
